+Task9 implements real bounded minutes source/config/profile/review/final graph validation, actual initial settings and accepted replay, the durable authenticated controlled provider protocol, and the genuine Task7 Worker/marker/permit/private-observer candidate materialization path. Enqueue fixes the input at the original business revision without advancing the meeting or clearing debt. The full historical identity union precedes subject/root/task/execution locks; expensive I/O, parsing and hashing occur outside the fresh protected gate. The writer and terminal replay validate the complete original source and candidate graph, exact input/task/fingerprint/subject/current binding and private issuer/holder, and do not duplicate graph writes.
